source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"This game's protagonist. Lost his mother when he was young. His father later on married Misako, who was his swimming instructor. However his father passed away as well, and now he lives alone with Misako. At some point, he quit swimming, but he doesn't want to think about his reason behind it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because he's used to calling Misako as \"Misako-san\", he's still unable to call her \"mom\". He thought of taking a part time job in order to buy Misako a present to show his gratitude for all she has done for him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40756"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作品の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に母を失い、通っていたスイミングスクールのインストラクターであった『美佐子』と父が再婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後、父にも先立たれ、今は『美佐子』と二人暮らし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から続けていた水泳は、今は辞めてしまい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何がきっかけて辞めてしまったのか理由を思い出せずに居る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『美佐子』の事を「美佐子さん」と呼び続けてた所為で今でも「お母さん」と呼べず、何かきっかけを探している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『美佐子』に感謝の気持ちを伝えようとプレゼント購入の為にアルバイトを思いつく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7186","sourceWorkId":"22386","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。 幼い頃に母を失い、水泳のインストラクターであった美佐子と父が再婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後 父にも先立たれ、今は美佐子と二人暮らし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつからか水泳は辞めてしまい、何がキッカケでそうしたのかは思い出せずにいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美佐子を 「美佐子さん」 と呼び続けていたせいで、今でも 「お母さん」 と呼べずにいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美佐子に日頃の感謝の気持ちを伝えようと、プレゼント購入のためにアルバイトを思いつく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91727"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"171 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7186","sourceWorkId":"22386","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"61 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7186","sourceWorkId":"22386","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url"