igure."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sometimes, she remembers the period when she was a young woman, and acts bashfully which is unbecoming for her age. She's exuding an allure of a mature woman, and she also teaches Taito about a woman's ABCs."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Don't look at me so much... Oba-san is getting embarrassed..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40758"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美佐子の古くからの友人で、二児の母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ダイエットも兼ねてスイミングスクールで働くが一向に痩せる様子は無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分のスタイルを恥じる事なく底抜けに明るく能天気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでも時折、女である自分を思い出し年甲斐もなく恥じらったりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成熟した大人の色香を漂わし太斗に女性のイロハを教えてくれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7190","sourceWorkId":"22386","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美佐子の古くからの友人で、二児の母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ダイエットも兼ねてスイミングスクールで働くが、一向に痩せる様子はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし自分のスタイルを恥じることなく底抜けに明るく能天気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでも時折 女である自分を思い出し、年甲斐もなく恥じらったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成熟した大人の色香を漂わし、太斗に女性のイロハを教えてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あんまり見ないで…… おばさん恥ずかしいわ……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91725"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"29 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7190","sourceWorkId":"22386","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"98 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7190","sourceWorkId":"22386","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7190","sourceWorkId":"22386","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7190","sourceWorkId":"22386","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"99 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7190","sourceWorkId":"22386","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label"